            0.382
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Replace the nichrome wire with the torch bulb in the circuit and find the current through it by measuring the reading of the ammeter.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
